  "decision": "Retain isolated frozen-model BCS staging. This report measures the actual Short critical path and preserves both orderings and matched L0 controls. Fixed queue ordinal8 is diagnostic;production must wire the explicit adapter copy_engine argument before adoption.",
  "caveats": [
    "Frozen v14 plus calibrated Windows raw Copy-node BLT. Concurrent live local-ID/storage/resident/lookup/MTP edits are excluded;mathematical objects and module manifest are fixed.",
